        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot for the stars, let their song fill everyone's hearts, and bring justice long overdue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of Teacher on the idols' journey to greatness. Guide their training with four different puzzle mini games, each testing your wit and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your best and you can make it all the way to Star-Filled Sky Festival. There, idols become stars and the evil Professor Kerr awaits your revenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main story, put the right idols together to experience twelve unique storylines told between them.</p>",
